  "description": "Guides clinical research design from hypothesis to ethics application and manuscript: skills for hypothesis, design and feasibility, sample size, data dictionary, SAP, ethics, and venue selection, plus optional prediction-model/ML and LLM-extraction modules and reviewer agents. Literature review is delegated to dedicated tools (for example the lr-ai plugin); a PubMed bridge adds a MeSH-aware PubMed search to an lr-ai review.",
